## Conventions

- Functional components only, no class components
- Named exports for components: `export function Button()`
- Props interface co-located: `interface ButtonProps {}`
- Server components by default, `'use client'` only when needed
- Custom hooks prefixed with `use`: `useAuth`, `useDebounce`
- Components handle loading, error, and empty states

